h of an electron so that it arrives at the other end at a controlled rate. Current resistors create a bottleneck to slow down electron flow. Bottlenecks create pressure, friction, and heat. Gemstone capacitors bend the path of an electron with a lense so that the electrons must follow a longer path to reach their destination. This elongated path also acts as a buffer to contain electrons on this elongated path. This type of resistor acts as a capacitor.  Time crystals:  If a crystal elongates the path of an electron. Time is literally dialated for an electron within this path. An electron could travel for 1 hour in a crystal and from the outside of the crystal we would see it only 1 second after pressing a switch.","topics":[],"score":211768,"global_rank":259851},{"name":"natelong/sdfgen","owner":"natelong","html_url":"https://github.com/natelong/sdfgen","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"Simple, cross-platform SDF texture generator","topics":[],"score":211768,"global_rank":259853},{"name":"danaimone/danaimone","owner":"danaimone","html_url":"https://github.com/danaimone/danaimone","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211767,"global_rank":259857},{"name":"akkaneror/akkaneror","owner":"akkaneror","html_url":"https://github.com/akkaneror/akkaneror","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211767,"global_rank":259858},{"name":"meganrogge/phoneApp","owner":"meganrogge","html_url":"https://github.com/meganrogge/phoneApp","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":211766,"global_rank":259859},{"name":"krishnabathini/workout-tracker","owner":"krishnabathini","html_url":"https://github.com/krishnabathini/workout-tracker","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"GitLifting - My workout progression tracker","topi